MINIMAX(node, depth, maximizingPlayer)

If node is terminal OR depth == 0

    Return evaluation(node)

If maximizingPlayer

    best = -∞

    For each child

        value = MINIMAX(child, depth-1, False)

        best = max(best, value)

    Return best

Else

    best = +∞

    For each child

        value = MINIMAX(child, depth-1, True)

        best = min(best, value)

    Return best